Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.21,0:03:00.98,EDJP1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}「For my love, I'll bet」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.98,0:03:04.02,EDJP1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}命こそを銃弾に
